<title>CHILE: Chile's steelmaker CAP Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's steelmaker CAP Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel producer CAP SA reported the following results in the first three months of the year.</p>
<p>		    Q1 1997		Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit	  8.6	 profit  5.2</p>
<p>Oper profit	20.1	 profit 16.7</p>
<p>Non-oper loss    10.7	   loss 10.6</p>
<p>Total revenues  177.5		  154.4</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in millions of dollars. ((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
